WEBVTT

00:24.831 --> 00:25.961
Oh! I saw a flash.

00:29.751 --> 00:31.671
-Hey!
-What's that?

00:47.521 --> 00:48.731
Oh, really?

00:48.811 --> 00:50.941
Then this is where we say goodbye.

00:51.031 --> 00:53.191
I'm in a hurry. Excuse me.

01:13.551 --> 01:16.551
Don't put on airs, you grunts.

01:18.141 --> 01:19.351
If you want to leave,

01:19.431 --> 01:23.101
then go wash your ass in that river
and line up for Thorkell.

01:24.101 --> 01:26.561
That's all you need do.

01:26.641 --> 01:30.311
What Thorkell wants is the prince's ass.

01:31.731 --> 01:32.731
Hey, Askeladd.

01:33.731 --> 01:37.111
We've known each other for a long time.
I don't want to kill you.

01:37.201 --> 01:39.991
Leave the prince here and disappear.

03:27.811 --> 03:28.641
Avalon?

03:31.351 --> 03:33.021
Is that the name of a place?

03:33.101 --> 03:34.731
SERVANT

03:34.811 --> 03:36.361
Yes.

03:36.441 --> 03:38.441
It's the name of heaven.

03:39.491 --> 03:42.661
Our great ancestor, King Artorius,

03:43.661 --> 03:45.321
is over there.

03:48.831 --> 03:52.291
But, Mother... King Artorius

03:52.371 --> 03:54.331
is a general from a long time ago.

03:56.251 --> 03:57.631
Is he still alive?

04:02.841 --> 04:04.721
Avalon

04:04.801 --> 04:08.311
lies far across the great sea to the west.

04:08.391 --> 04:11.931
It's a land of everlasting spring, where the fairies live.

04:12.941 --> 04:17.111
It's a place free from the suffering
of death and old age in this life.

04:17.191 --> 04:19.021
He's recovering

04:19.111 --> 04:21.821
from his battle wounds there.

04:24.451 --> 04:28.741
Once his wounds have healed, King Artorius

04:28.831 --> 04:31.831
will come back for us.

04:32.831 --> 04:35.751
To save us from our suffering.

04:40.841 --> 04:42.461
When that happens,

04:43.471 --> 04:46.011
serve the king.

04:47.221 --> 04:48.971
He's

04:49.051 --> 04:51.471
the true king, and a warrior.

04:54.351 --> 04:56.901
Become his staff

04:56.981 --> 04:58.231
and his sword...

04:59.771 --> 05:01.151
someday.

05:06.661 --> 05:08.281
Can I talk to you

05:08.371 --> 05:10.201
before we say goodbye?

05:11.201 --> 05:13.121
It won't change anything.

05:13.201 --> 05:17.671
We've been together for a long time.

05:18.881 --> 05:20.711
We laughed together,

05:20.791 --> 05:22.881
we drank together,

05:22.961 --> 05:26.381
and we made it through hell and back many times.

05:30.301 --> 05:32.811
I've never told you this before.

05:34.021 --> 05:37.941
For the last decade we've spent together...

05:40.771 --> 05:42.821
I actually

05:42.901 --> 05:44.991
hated you guys.

05:45.991 --> 05:48.071
-What?
-What?

05:48.161 --> 05:51.081
You worthless Danes. You're worse than pigs.

06:00.291 --> 06:03.381
Damn! Get the prince!

06:05.421 --> 06:06.341
Thorfinn!

06:15.811 --> 06:18.391
You kids, hold on tight!

06:18.481 --> 06:19.651
Hurry!

06:21.311 --> 06:23.481
Damn!

06:23.571 --> 06:25.981
Damn! They were on to us!

06:26.071 --> 06:28.491
Follow them! Don't let them get away!

06:28.571 --> 06:30.991
Go! Go! Go!

06:31.071 --> 06:34.081
All right! I won't let you!

06:36.371 --> 06:39.791
The river! Follow the sled! Go!

06:43.881 --> 06:47.881
My men are impressive.
They're good at judging the situation.

06:50.091 --> 06:51.721
Very well.

06:57.851 --> 06:59.941
You got me.

07:02.231 --> 07:05.271
It looks like you didn't have enough faith.

07:12.491 --> 07:14.531
They're far away. I can't see them well.

07:15.531 --> 07:17.661
But it looks like they're fighting.

07:18.831 --> 07:20.371
They're fighting amongst themselves.

07:20.461 --> 07:22.501
It happens a lot in times like this.

07:22.581 --> 07:24.461
How pitiful.

07:24.541 --> 07:25.541
These days

07:25.631 --> 07:27.551
everyone's afraid to die.

07:28.551 --> 07:32.261
This is outrageous!

07:32.341 --> 07:35.221
How dare they start the fight without me?

07:35.301 --> 07:36.141
That's his problem?

07:36.221 --> 07:38.311
Let me join! Let me join!

07:46.231 --> 07:47.611
Surround them! Surround them!

07:47.691 --> 07:49.441
The horses! Kill their horses!

07:55.741 --> 07:58.161
What are you doing? Kill them, Thorfinn!

07:58.241 --> 07:59.491
Throw your knives!

07:59.581 --> 08:01.661
Shut up! I'm out of throwing knives!

08:02.661 --> 08:05.421
Damn! Askeladd's not here yet!

08:05.501 --> 08:07.171
What is that baldy doing?

08:09.211 --> 08:12.421
Stop, Bjorn! Listen to us!

08:12.511 --> 08:15.761
You think I'm stupid enough to actually stop?

08:15.841 --> 08:16.931
Don't forget who I am!

08:19.011 --> 08:22.811
Think about it, Bjorn! Whether we live or die

08:22.891 --> 08:25.561
all depends on what we do with the prince!

08:25.651 --> 08:30.031
It's no use, Atli! Bjorn obeys Askeladd completely.

08:30.111 --> 08:31.611
We can't convince him.

08:31.691 --> 08:33.321
We'll just have to kill him!

08:33.401 --> 08:37.201
Yeah. Looks like you do understand.

08:37.281 --> 08:40.201
Askeladd trusts me.
That's why he left the prince with me.

08:40.291 --> 08:42.701
If you want to take the prince from me,

08:42.791 --> 08:44.871
prepare to die!

08:44.961 --> 08:46.711
You cowards!

08:46.791 --> 08:50.131
Hey! I told you to attack me!

08:50.211 --> 08:53.381
Not the horses! No! Hey!

08:53.471 --> 08:54.721
We're going to crash!

09:18.281 --> 09:22.741
-Hey! Thorfinn's running away!
-Don't worry about him. Forget it.

09:22.831 --> 09:24.581
Hey, prince. Are you alive?

09:24.661 --> 09:26.421
Don't be so reckless!

09:26.501 --> 09:27.671
Prince! Hey!

09:31.751 --> 09:33.801
He's alive.

09:33.881 --> 09:35.921
All right! Let's go back.

09:41.471 --> 09:43.721
You're not going anywhere yet,

09:43.811 --> 09:45.891
you losers!

09:46.891 --> 09:49.651
You're still alive, Bjorn?

09:49.731 --> 09:51.521
What? That mushroom!

09:51.611 --> 09:54.361
Come at me, all of you at once!

09:56.151 --> 09:59.201
I'll take you all to Valhalla!

10:02.531 --> 10:04.751
Damn! Damn! Damn!

10:04.831 --> 10:07.461
You put me through so much trouble! You baldy!

10:07.541 --> 10:10.961
You better not die until I kill you,

10:11.041 --> 10:12.591
Askeladd!

10:26.561 --> 10:28.561
Oh, dear.

10:28.641 --> 10:31.101
I don't like getting old.

10:32.191 --> 10:34.521
Who ever thought

10:34.611 --> 10:38.031
that I'd be unable to escape
from a mere 50 men one day?

11:06.061 --> 11:07.431
Wait for it.

11:07.521 --> 11:09.141
Wait for your chance to escape.

11:20.781 --> 11:22.991
Thorkell's going to get here soon.

11:23.991 --> 11:25.621
It's going to be chaos.

11:34.041 --> 11:36.921
You bastard!

11:45.351 --> 11:46.851
Did you see that?

11:46.931 --> 11:48.061
I saw it.

11:48.141 --> 11:49.391
He cut through his helmet.

11:49.471 --> 11:51.731
Not even my ax can cut like that.

11:51.811 --> 11:54.651
Damn. He's good.

11:59.321 --> 12:03.071
Damn. I shouldn't have lost my temper.

12:05.661 --> 12:09.121
Oh, sorry I was being loud.

12:09.201 --> 12:10.661
All right. Come on.

12:10.751 --> 12:13.621
I'm not mad anymore.

12:21.471 --> 12:25.181
Everyone to the east, stand back!
You're going to get hit by the stray arrows!

12:26.761 --> 12:29.641
They took out their flying toys.

12:32.981 --> 12:34.731
Torgrim.

12:34.811 --> 12:36.521
Are you the one in charge?

12:36.611 --> 12:39.361
So what if I am? You bastard.

12:39.441 --> 12:42.781
Are you sure you're okay with this?
Even I would die from that.

12:42.861 --> 12:44.611
Who cares?

12:44.701 --> 12:47.161
Bjorn and Thorfinn are good.

12:47.241 --> 12:50.161
They'll kill you if you go after them.

12:50.241 --> 12:51.751
If you want to get the prince,

12:51.831 --> 12:54.581
you'll need me.

12:55.961 --> 12:58.961
If you take me hostage,

12:59.041 --> 13:02.961
then Bjorn will come back to exchange me for the prince.

13:03.051 --> 13:05.511
That's only if I'm still alive, though.

13:08.261 --> 13:09.971
What are you going to do, Torgrim?

13:11.221 --> 13:12.271
Aim for his legs.

13:18.311 --> 13:19.271
Yeah!

13:19.361 --> 13:20.981
We did it!

13:35.041 --> 13:37.331
You're not acting like yourself, Askeladd.

13:38.631 --> 13:42.001
You were never this desperate.

13:42.091 --> 13:46.591
Normally, you'd avoid fighting
worthless battles.

13:47.591 --> 13:51.301
Why do you risk your life for that coward of a prince?

13:51.391 --> 13:54.391
Do you plan on taking your prize to the grave with you?

14:01.061 --> 14:03.731
I'm already old.

14:03.821 --> 14:07.201
I don't have a lot of time left
where I can still work.

14:10.071 --> 14:11.621
I just...

14:13.411 --> 14:15.621
couldn't wait any longer.

14:19.831 --> 14:21.081
I couldn't wait anymore

14:22.291 --> 14:26.051
for the true king to return from Avalon.

14:44.821 --> 14:46.611
You don't make any sense.

14:47.611 --> 14:49.491
That's enough. Finish him.

14:51.951 --> 14:53.281
Hey! What's wrong?

15:00.171 --> 15:04.091
Hey! Are you having fun, guys?

15:06.171 --> 15:10.051
Which one is Askeladd? Your leader.

15:10.131 --> 15:13.011
I can't wait to meet him.

15:15.431 --> 15:16.641
Too bad.

15:19.181 --> 15:21.941
I don't see anyone without an appointment.

15:46.171 --> 15:48.341
You really are big.

15:49.551 --> 15:51.221
Now that I've seen you up close.

15:57.681 --> 16:00.101
I'm Torgrim.

16:00.181 --> 16:04.021
I'm not going to resist. I just want you to listen.

16:15.031 --> 16:17.741
Captain. The prince isn't here.

16:18.991 --> 16:20.701
Oh, that's right!

16:20.791 --> 16:23.001
That's what I was going to talk to you about.

16:23.081 --> 16:27.001
We were planning to give you the prince.

16:27.091 --> 16:31.671
But our leader Askeladd let him get away.

16:31.761 --> 16:33.381
But don't worry.

16:33.471 --> 16:36.391
We sent ten men after him.

16:36.471 --> 16:40.141
Just leave it to us.

16:40.221 --> 16:44.141
I swear in the name of Odin.
We'll get him back, no matter what.

16:44.231 --> 16:47.731
We also have other aces up our sleeve.

16:47.811 --> 16:49.901
What? Wait... Hey!

16:55.571 --> 16:58.121
So, you're Askeladd.

16:58.201 --> 17:00.621
You look pretty smart.

17:03.411 --> 17:05.081
By the way,

17:05.171 --> 17:08.211
I don't see Thorfinn around.

17:08.291 --> 17:10.041
Did you kill him?

17:11.251 --> 17:13.051
I didn't kill him.

17:13.131 --> 17:15.341
I asked him to guard the prince.

17:15.431 --> 17:18.261
He's not part of this rebellion.

17:18.341 --> 17:22.351
I see! I'm relieved to hear that.

17:25.021 --> 17:29.481
All right! Thanks for waiting, you dogs!

17:31.271 --> 17:33.741
Except for Askeladd,

17:33.821 --> 17:35.531
kill them all!

17:45.831 --> 17:48.541
This wasn't part of the deal, Torgrim!

17:48.631 --> 17:50.881
Hey, you guys.

17:50.961 --> 17:54.711
Pick up your weapons. Act like a warrior
for your final moments.

17:57.551 --> 18:00.011
Hurry up. Pick it up.

18:00.091 --> 18:02.851
I'm saying this for your own good.

18:02.931 --> 18:06.891
You won't be able to go to Valhalla if you die
without a weapon.

18:13.901 --> 18:16.651
Damn it all!

18:25.831 --> 18:28.541
Great. This is how it's supposed to be.

18:28.621 --> 18:30.421
Wait! Wait, Thorkell!

18:30.501 --> 18:32.881
Are you sure? Are you sure about this?

18:32.961 --> 18:35.921
If you kill us, you won't be able to get the prince!

18:36.011 --> 18:39.341
Yeah. That's okay. I'll get him myself.

18:42.051 --> 18:44.811
Hey. It's your ax.

18:44.891 --> 18:46.981
Attack me!

18:47.061 --> 18:50.481
If you call yourself a warrior, then try feeling good
when you die.

18:57.151 --> 19:02.031
One, two, three, four.
Two, two, three, four...

19:02.121 --> 19:04.661
I feel your pain, Torgrim.

19:04.741 --> 19:06.621
-My heart--
-Silence!

19:06.701 --> 19:08.711
It's all your fault!

19:10.041 --> 19:13.501
Just give up, Torgrim.

19:13.591 --> 19:15.461
You're going to die now.

19:16.711 --> 19:18.881
You're going to die without a doubt.

19:21.431 --> 19:25.601
So, die while fighting. Okay?

19:25.681 --> 19:27.811
I'll help you.

19:30.391 --> 19:33.651
Now then! Attack me! Come on!

19:34.691 --> 19:35.611
Hey!

19:53.041 --> 19:54.541
This is no good!

19:55.541 --> 19:58.131
Looks like I put too much pressure on you.

20:00.381 --> 20:01.971
This is no good.

20:02.051 --> 20:04.011
He's gone now.

20:05.181 --> 20:06.431
Hello?

20:19.281 --> 20:20.281
What's that?

20:35.291 --> 20:36.671
Thorfinn!

21:08.741 --> 21:11.661
Hey! Thorfinn!
You look like you've been doing well!

21:11.741 --> 21:13.711
Don't touch Askeladd!

21:13.791 --> 21:16.461
He's my catch!

21:16.541 --> 21:19.841
If you lay even one finger on him, I'm going to kill you!

21:19.921 --> 21:23.841
Got it, big guy? If you touch him, I'm going to kill you!

21:26.341 --> 21:30.181
I... I always knew you were crazy, but...

21:31.851 --> 21:35.391
A mouse is picking a fight with a bear.

21:40.771 --> 21:42.191
Your catch?

21:42.281 --> 21:44.691
He's your boss, right?

21:44.781 --> 21:46.701
He's not my boss!

21:46.781 --> 21:50.201
What? What the heck?

21:50.281 --> 21:54.081
Did you hear that? That kid said
he's going to kill our captain.

21:54.161 --> 21:56.961
Oh, he has a lot of guts to say that.

21:58.621 --> 22:01.591
Give me Askeladd.

22:01.671 --> 22:03.801
If you don't, I'm going to kill you.

22:03.881 --> 22:05.671
Really?

22:05.761 --> 22:08.431
Then I'm not going to.

22:08.511 --> 22:10.301
Did you hear that?

22:10.391 --> 22:12.681
Thorfinn and I just agreed

22:12.761 --> 22:16.431
to a duel over Askeladd!

22:16.521 --> 22:19.941
You guys are the witnesses!

22:20.021 --> 22:21.401
Yeah!

22:21.481 --> 22:24.151
You did it!

22:24.231 --> 22:27.451
That bastard... How dare he...

22:27.531 --> 22:29.701
Yeah! You can do it!

22:36.121 --> 22:37.501
Thorfinn.

22:38.541 --> 22:41.711
If you win, I'll let him go.

22:41.791 --> 22:44.251
I'll even give you a horse.

22:46.381 --> 22:49.381
This time isn't going to be like in London.

22:50.551 --> 22:53.431
Oh, I'm looking forward to that,

22:53.511 --> 22:55.311
son of Thors!

23:05.821 --> 23:08.821
The last in a line of warriors!
